        "key": "ui.chat.trace.send.mode.wake",
        "finding": "«пробуждение» is a noun while its siblings send.mode.now «сразу» and send.mode.quiet «тихо» are adverbs, so the three delivery-mode words read as mixed parts of speech in the tool-row summary. Meaning is correct and matches the ru glossary (wake = пробуждение). Suggestion: «с пробуждением». Disposition: deferred, non-gating NIT."
      },
      {
        "id": "RU-W2-2",
        "severity": "nit",
        "key": "ui.chat.canonical.supplement.graphics.show",
        "finding": "The graphics toggles (graphics.show, graphics.show_all, graphics.show_head, graphics.hide) call a highlights graphic «иллюстрация», while the existing supplement keys of the same namespace use «графика» (supplement.adjust_placeholder «Изменить графику…», supplement.frame.loading «Загрузка графики…», supplement.frame.failed). Justified: «графика» is an uncountable mass noun and cannot take plural counts (*«3 графики» for '3 graphics'), so a countable noun was required; plural/case agreement of «иллюстрация» is correct at every rendered count. Disposition: accepted as is, non-gating NIT; optional later alignment would be «диаграмма»/«график» if the glossary is revisited."
      }
    ]
